codex
Rejected honestly on Track B after G9(b).

- G1–G8 passed; random guessing was 0/200,000.
- Bare `hard` oracle run: 0/3 solved.
- Structural-hint run: 1/1 solved, which is immediately disqualifying.
- The paper provides existence results, not distributional hardness supporting Track A. See [arXiv:2602.19989](https://arxiv.org/html/2602.19989v1).

Artifacts:

- [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2602.19989/REJECTED.md)
- [retained generator](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2602.19989/rejected_gen_2602_19989.py)
- [selftest report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2602.19989/selftest_report.json)
- [bare transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2602.19989/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
